<title>PHILIPPINES: Golf - Scores after third round of Super Tour.</title>
<headline>Golf - Scores after third round of Super Tour.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores after the third round of the $350,000 Johnnie Walker Super Tour on Friday:</p>
<p>209 Ernie Els (South Africa) 67 71 71</p>
<p>211 Colin Montgomerie (Scotland) 68 72 71, Ian Woosnam (Wales)</p>
<p>68 70 73</p>
<p>212 Lin Keng-chi (Taiwan) 67 73 72</p>
<p>214 Park Nam-sin (South Korea) 67 72 75</p>
<p>221 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 72 71 78</p>
<p>223 Chawalit Plaphol (Thailand) 75 71 77</p>
<p>225 Felix Casas (Philippines) 71 76 78</p>
</text>
